From: Antigravity (locally tested) / reviewed for integration
Subject: [PATCH 0013] D3D12: expand shader caches and mitigate SPU GETLLAR contention

Retains the supplied 0013 cache sizes, reverse lookups and MRU promotion.
Integration adjustments:
- Preserve valid VS/FP cache comments and patch context.
- Unlock the reservation line before yielding the host thread.
- Keep the diagnostic GETLLAR log and bound the submitted PSO array.
- Claimed scene FPS and local benchmark gains require independent reproduction.

